sequenceDiagram
%% process-key: release-readiness-and-deployment
    participant role_change_manager as Change manager
    participant role_delivery_manager as Delivery manager
    participant role_service_owner as Service owner
    participant role_qa_lead as QA lead
    participant role_security_reviewer as Security reviewer
    participant role_platform_engineer as Platform engineer
    participant role_release_approver as Release approver
    participant system as Release readiness and deployment control
    role_change_manager->>system: Freeze release scope and deployment boundary
    system-->>role_change_manager: evidence -> Release scope freeze note, Deployment strategy outline
    role_delivery_manager->>system: Synthesize readiness evidence and open risks
    system-->>role_delivery_manager: evidence -> Release readiness report, Test evidence pack
    role_change_manager->>system: Rehearse cutover and confirm watch coverage
    system-->>role_change_manager: evidence -> Cutover watch roster, Rollback plan
    role_change_manager->>system: Run final security review and go/no-go approval
    system-->>role_change_manager: evidence -> Security review note, Final go/no-go decision
    Note over system: branches -> Go, Hold
    role_platform_engineer->>system: Execute cutover and observe live telemetry
    system-->>role_platform_engineer: evidence -> Rollback plan, Release execution provenance note
    role_service_owner->>system: Confirm stability, close watch, and capture learning
    system-->>role_service_owner: evidence -> Retrospective improvement log, Release closure note
